{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":78347,\"title\":\"Tree in the River\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Chu Zhi He who's a goodie two shoes and Wang Da Shu who has a personality that is rigid and sturdy like a tree learn to grow together as they fall in love. Like the show's namesake, animal behavior is quite representative of human nature. Take the giraffe and the squirrel for example, they are a metaphor for two very different people who find a way to coexist.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zjemiydSQXWNZunxCYnmXnpPN1u.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dAJKKFlbweBKhMZg8TtVdfsb5aA.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2018,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":20,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"Sohu Video\",\"TTV Main Channel\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"TW\",\"name\":\"Taiwan\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2018-05-10\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1106982,\"name\":\"Qu You-ning\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mPiU8olIeJPLX596fRrGvHQ7ZNJ.jpg\"},{\"id\":64433,\"name\":\"Gillian Chung\",\"character\":\"Chu Zhi He / \\\"River\\\"\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4JjevqOLAgAdm8VhMgsD4vd2PY2.jpg\"},{\"id\":126793,\"name\":\"Mike He\",\"character\":\"Wang Da Shu\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Ate5n3WqQSdQDivmr1X1xNG4nXr.jpg\"},{\"id\":1255149,\"name\":\"Sonia Sui\",\"character\":\"Fen Ni\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rI8XoREa1s4MeZVffzcU85uXvk5.jpg\"},{\"id\":239999,\"name\":\"Ray Chang\",\"character\":\"Qin Hao\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5nHNs7opKdxqjqZGrd9QYl40G25.jpg\"},{\"id\":1309561,\"name\":\"Jerry Huang\",\"character\":\"Cha Ding Gui\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w2NcAtW4VhbFvucxTijp9vfoSac.jpg\"},{\"id\":1611476,\"name\":\"Ken Hung\",\"character\":\"Jason Shi\",\"photo\":\"https://image.